      "en": "They passed from there to the hill country of Ephraim, and came to the house of Micah.",
      "ko": "무리가 거기서 떠나서 에브라임 산지 미가의 집에 이르니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e02a8970dbeeeb94de17c1c078300de53ccd742d7a53f8c0451b5dba028893d3",
      "translation_text_hash": "92f77bb64081c36268d6a41f6aec98e22030f9d9cabd8af974a94d4afe9d26e1",
