      "en": "They went over there and came to the house of the young Levite man, even to the house of Micah, and asked him how he was doing.",
      "ko": "다섯 사람이 그 편으로 향하여 소년 레위 사람의 집 곧 미가의 집에 이르러 문안하고",
      "source_text_hash": "9fff278888c8d39f2e98b9073deedac05b182685d1a9979d683004f8b9b31151",
      "translation_text_hash": "4e13fd46cff134d432157dee5d80da252e2c0c55c492947c2301ae4c23532c8b",
