      "en": "So they turned and departed, and put the little ones, the livestock, and the goods before them.",
      "ko": "그들이 돌이켜서 어린 아이들과 가축과 물품을 앞에 두고 진행하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "377ff26da771a9cd001c90eff596d26f764e6bc3af44b81b19d5f670daee727c",
      "translation_text_hash": "c7d865cdfbfa5f67ee9c1280158fba9cd386332d75807e63875a62a3f148c4a5",
