      ],
      "en": "They took that which Micah had made, and the priest whom he had, and came to Laish, to a people quiet and unsuspecting, and struck them with the edge of the sword; then they burned the city with fire.",
      "ko": "단 자손이 미가의 지은 것과 그 제사장을 취하고 라이스에 이르러 한가하고 평안한 백성을 만나 칼날로 그들을 치며 불로 그 성읍을 사르되",
      "source_text_hash": "bc70fa32b28f1e954718c5e49bf6522e892cddfcb0505873132b73d46af983fd",
      "translation_text_hash": "1406312f5c65b2ff18d22c7c8dc108894eef791d59da33e4e623e61f46f126e3",
